│                          │ requires directional evidence before accepting small opposite movements. This reduces     │
│                          │ noise-induced slope changes and false reversals without introducing a full sliding-window │
│                          │ delay. The public functions, parameters, output lengths, alignment, and result dictionary │
│                          │ remain unchanged.                                                                         │
