│                          │ Resetting pending evidence unless slope and displacement agree rejects these inconsistent │
│                          │ excursions. A large displacement retains the existing immediate-turn path, preserving     │
│                          │ responsiveness to sharp genuine corners while reducing slope changes and false reversals. │
